    "detailed_description": "As the fabled Hand of Anima, only you can save the realm with your unique ability to fuse magical spells together to make them even more powerful. Hand of Anima is a roguelike deckbuilder where you fuse cards together to defeat fearsome enemies attempting to corrupt the realm of Erdia.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fuse Cards to Unleash Their Potential!</h2>Turn the tides of battle by fusing cards together! Experiment with different combinations of card fusions to unlock each card's full potential. But be wary - sometimes, the situation may call for playing two cards on their own, rather than fusing them. The choice is yours!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848020/extras/4e840435bcbe56e6896f52d2ff36b9e0.poster.avif?t=1723475881\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848020/extras/4e840435bcbe56e6896f52d2ff36b9e0.webm?t=1723475881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848020/extras/4e840435bcbe56e6896f52d2ff36b9e0.mp4?t=1723475881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Decks with Class Synergies!</h2>With four archetypes to choose from at the start of each run, explore different strategies to get the most out of each card in your deck. Draft new cards into your deck as you progress through the map, and discover potent synergies that would send the fiercest foes running.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848020/extras/96a847010f5ecc5155e8d7208f63880a.poster.avif?t=1723475881\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848020/extras/96a847010f5ecc5155e8d7208f63880a.webm?t=1723475881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848020/extras/96a847010f5ecc5155e8d7208f63880a.mp4?t=1723475881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Own Path!</h2>As you navigate the realm of Erdia, make important choices every step of the way on your path to vanquish darkness from this realm. No two adventures will be the same.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848020/extras/15741bc60a0b3d8db372d9fb28736e25.avif?t=1723475881\" width=600 height=230 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Each Adventure is a New Beginning</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fuse cards together to unleash their full power<br></li><li>Battle challenging enemies in turn-based combat<br></li><li>Craft powerful decks with potent synergies<br></li><li>Navigate diverse biomes with ever-changing maps<br></li><li>Equip runes to augment your journey in and out of battle<br></li><li>Unlock new cards, realms, and more as you play!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "As the fabled Hand of Anima, only you can save the realm with your unique ability to fuse magical spells together to make them even more powerful. Hand of Anima is a roguelike deckbuilder where you fuse cards together to defeat fearsome enemies attempting to corrupt the realm of Erdia.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fuse Cards to Unleash Their Potential!</h2>Turn the tides of battle by fusing cards together! Experiment with different combinations of card fusions to unlock each card's full potential. But be wary - sometimes, the situation may call for playing two cards on their own, rather than fusing them. The choice is yours!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848020/extras/4e840435bcbe56e6896f52d2ff36b9e0.poster.avif?t=1723475881\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848020/extras/4e840435bcbe56e6896f52d2ff36b9e0.webm?t=1723475881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848020/extras/4e840435bcbe56e6896f52d2ff36b9e0.mp4?t=1723475881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Decks with Class Synergies!</h2>With four archetypes to choose from at the start of each run, explore different strategies to get the most out of each card in your deck. Draft new cards into your deck as you progress through the map, and discover potent synergies that would send the fiercest foes running.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848020/extras/96a847010f5ecc5155e8d7208f63880a.poster.avif?t=1723475881\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848020/extras/96a847010f5ecc5155e8d7208f63880a.webm?t=1723475881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848020/extras/96a847010f5ecc5155e8d7208f63880a.mp4?t=1723475881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Own Path!</h2>As you navigate the realm of Erdia, make important choices every step of the way on your path to vanquish darkness from this realm. No two adventures will be the same.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2848020/extras/15741bc60a0b3d8db372d9fb28736e25.avif?t=1723475881\" width=600 height=230 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Each Adventure is a New Beginning</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fuse cards together to unleash their full power<br></li><li>Battle challenging enemies in turn-based combat<br></li><li>Craft powerful decks with potent synergies<br></li><li>Navigate diverse biomes with ever-changing maps<br></li><li>Equip runes to augment your journey in and out of battle<br></li><li>Unlock new cards, realms, and more as you play!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Fuse cards together in this roguelike deckbuilder to unleash their full potential. Discover powerful fusion combinations, build decks with potent synergies, harness abilities from ancient runes, and defeat challenging enemies on your quest to restore peace to the realm of Erdia.",
